.TH SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_ENUMERATE_ONLY_CONTROLLERS 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_ENUMERATE_ONLY_CONTROLLERS \- A variable to control whether
.BR SDL_hid_enumerate ()
enumerates all HID devices or only controllers.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_ENUMERATE_ONLY_CONTROLLERS \(dqSDL_HIDAPI_ENUMERATE_ONLY_CONTROLLERS\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq0\(dq:
.BR SDL_hid_enumerate ()
will enumerate all HID devices\[char46]
.PP
\(bu \(dq1\(dq:
.BR SDL_hid_enumerate ()
will only enumerate controllers\[char46] (default)
.PP
By default SDL will only enumerate controllers, to reduce risk of hanging or crashing on devices with bad drivers and avoiding macOS keyboard capture permission prompts\[char46]
.PP
This hint can be set anytime\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

